This terminal is too small: vtium-config needs at least 80x25 characters, and
this terminal is 79x24.

Make this terminal larger, or use these commands, which work at any size:
  vtium-config flow
  vtium-config diff
  vtium-config install
  vtium-config get
  vtium-config set
  vtium-config revert
  vtium-config new
  vtium-config rule
  vtium-config head
  vtium-config look
  vtium-config draft
  vtium-config history
  vtium-config restore
  vtium-config library
  vtium-config edit
  vtium-config fonts
  vtium-config check
  vtium-config new-frit
Ctrl-C save and quit  q quit
Press u to put back the font the console started with.
